      "side": 1,
      "message": "This comment should state that it is filling in the empty lines between the just committed (previously pending) frags and the new frag just found.\n\nThough shouldn\u0027t this only be done if there are any? If the next frag is on the next line then there aren\u0027t any missing lines to add? It looks like this might add an extra 0 sized line between each consecutive lines with content?",
